<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TABLE-Prazska Energetika H1 gross lower.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Prazska Energetika H1 gross lower.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results for Prague</p>
<p>power distributor Prazska Energetika a.s. for</p>
<p>six-month period ending June 30, 1997: (in millions of crowns)</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit		     289.450     vs     454.796</p>
<p> After-tax profit		   279.771     vs     450.668</p>
<p> Operating profit		   305.970     vs     452.089</p>
<p> Depreciation			 282.949     vs     218.968</p>
<p> Sales of own goods/services  3,736.185     vs   3,684.377</p>
<p> sales of other goods		 3.828     vs	 1.689</p>
<p> basic capital		    3,869.443     vs   3,869.443</p>
<p> total assets		     8,841.660     vs   8,547.152</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
